e</u> contains:</span></label><input style=\'width:250px;\' type=\'text\' name=\'AppliTrackSearchTitle\' id=\'AppliTrackSearchTitle\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\' /></div><div><span class=\'fixedCol1 label\'>In Category:</span><select name=\'AppliTrackSearchCategory\' id=\'AppliTrackSearchCategory\' onchange=\'AppliTrack_SearchCategorySelect()\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\'><option style=\'color:#666;font-style: italic;\'>Select Category</option><option value=\'{id:"Maintenance/Custodial",vals:["Maintenance Supervisor"]}\'>Maintenance/Custodial</option><option value=\'{id:"Student Support Services",vals:["Substitute School Nurse"]}\'>Student Support Services</option><option value=\'{id:"Substitute",vals:["Substitute Teacher"]}\'>Substitute</option><option value=\'{id:"Substitute Support Services",vals:["Substitute Custodial","Substitute Para-Educator"]}\'>Substitute Support Services</option><option value=\'{id:"Transportation",vals:["Route Bus Driver"]}\'>Transportation</option></select><span class=\'label\'> and </span><span class=\'label\' style=\'white-space:nowrap\'>SubCategory:<select name=\'AppliTrackSearchSubCategory\' id=\'AppliTrackSearchSubCategory\' disabled=\'disabled\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\'><option></option></select></span></div><div><span class=\'fixedCol1 label\'>At Location:</span><select name=\'AppliTrackSearchLocation\' id=\'AppliTrackSearchLocation\' onchange=\'AppliTrack_RadiusSelect()\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\'><option value=\'\' style=\'font-style:italic;color:#999\'> -- Any Location -- </option><option value="District-Wide K-12">District-Wide K-12</option><option value="Transportation Department">Transportation Department</option></select></div><div id="AppliTrackSearchZipCodeSection"><span class=\'fixedCol1 label\'>Within:</span><select name=\'AppliTrackSearchRadius\' id=\'AppliTrackSearchRadius\' onchange=\'AppliTrack_SearchCategorySelect()\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\'><option value=\'5\'>5</option><option value=\'10\'>10</option><option value=\'15\'>15</option><option value=\'25\'>25</option><option value=\'50\'>50</option><option value=\'100\'>100</option><option value=\'150\'>150</option></select><span class=\'fixedCol1 label\' style=\'margin-left: -25px;\'>miles of Zip:</span><label for=\'AppliTrackZipCode\' class=\'HiddenButReadable\'>Zip Code</label><input style=\'width:70px;\' type=\'text\' name=\'AppliTrackZipCode\' id=\'AppliTrackZipCode\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\' /><stronge name=\'AppliTrackZipValidator\' id=\'AppliTrackZipValidator\' style=\'visibility:hidden;text-align: left;color:red;\'>Invalid Zipcode</stronge><input style=\'width:250px;\' type=\'hidden\' name=\'internal\' id=\'internal\' value=\'\'&nbsp; /></div><button id="AppliTrackSearchButton" type="button" style=\'float:right;margin-right:10px;cursor:pointer;\' onclick=\'AppliTrack_SearchExecute(null)\'>Search</button><div><span class=\'label\' style=\'width:125px;text-align:right;\'>Posted in the last:</span><select name=\'AppliTrackSearchPostDateRange\' id=\'AppliTrackSearchPostDateRange\' onKeyPress=\'return AppliTrack_WatchForEnter(event)\'><option value=\'\'>All Dates</option><option value=\'7\'>7 Days</option><option value=\'14\'>14 Days</option><option value=\'30\'>30 Days</option></select></div></div><div class=\'section\' style=\'vertical-align: top;\'><span style=\'white-space:nowrap\'><span class=\'header\'>Sort Results By:</span><select name=\'AppliTrackSort\' id=\'AppliTrackSort\' class=\'data\'><option class=\'data\' value=\'type\' selected=\'selected\'>type</option><option class=\'data\' value=\'title\'>title</option><option class=\'data\' value=\'location\'>location</option><option class=\'data\' value=\'newest\'>newest</option><option class=\'data\' value=\'oldest\'>oldest</option></select></span><span style=\'white-space:nowrap\'><span class=\'header\'>Display as:</span><select name=\'AppliTrackLayoutMode\' id=\'AppliTrackLayoutMode\' class=\'data\'><option value=\'detail\' selected=\'selected\'>Detailed View</option><option value=\'condensed\'>Condensed View</option></select></span></div></div><div id=\'AppliTrackSearchAdvancedHeaderExpanded\' style=\'display:none;\' onclick=\'AppliTrack_ToggleAdvancedSearch()\'>Options</div></div><div id=\'AppliTrackListContent\'><p align=center class=noprint id=\'p695_h\'><span class=\'ListHeader\'>Openings as of 10/30/2026<br/></span></p><ul class=\'postingsList\' id=\'p695_\'><table class=\'title\' style=\'padding: 0px; width:99.2%\'><tr><td id=\'wrapword\' style=\'width: 950px; padding: 5px;\'>Maintenance Supervisor</td><td style=\'width: 275px;\'><span class=\'title2\' style=\'float:right;text-align:right;margin-top: 8px;margin-right: 6px;\'> JobID: 695 <input type=\'button\' value=\' Apply \' onclick="applyFor(\'695\',\'Maintenance/Custodial\',\'Maintenance Supervisor\')" class=\'screenOnly ApplyButton\' /></span></td></tr></table><div style=\'position:relative;\'><li><span class=\'label\'>Position Type:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Maintenance/Custodial/</span><span class=\'normal\'>Maintenance Supervisor</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Posted:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">10/8/2026</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Location:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">District-Wide K-12</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Available:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>12/01/2026</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" > Closing Date: </span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Until Filled</span><br/><br/></li><span>&nbsp&nbsp</span>');
document.write('<span class="label" >Additional Information: &nbsp;</span><span class="normal"><a href="javascript:void(toggle_block(\'DescriptionText695_\'))"><u>Show/Hide</u></a></span><br/><span id=\'DescriptionText695_\' style=\'border: 1px solid black; padding:5px; display:none; opacity:.8;\'><span class="normal"><p style="text-align:center;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;"><strong>ANNOUNCEMENT OF VACANCY</strong></span></p><p><strong>Position:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>Maintenance Supervisor</p><p><strong>Duties:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>Administer and provide hands-on leadership and support for District maintenance, grounds, custodial services, facilities, safety, security, and emergency planning. Develop and manage departmental budgets and facility operational plans; oversee preventive maintenance, renovation and capital construction projects; coordinate required inspections, training, compliance, and reporting; and supervise and evaluate assigned personnel in cooperation with building principals and the Superintendent.</p><p><strong>Qualifications:</strong></p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">&nbsp;High school diploma required; technical degree, bachelor\'s degree, advanced degree, or relevant experience in facility renovation and construction preferred.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Formal training and/or experience coordinating building maintenance, grounds, custodial services, safety, or facility renovation/construction.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Strong budget development and management skills.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Demonstrated knowledge of building trades, including electrical, plumbing, HVAC, construction, water systems, and applicable code requirements.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Ability to develop, implement, and monitor District facility plans and coordinate effectively with state, city, county, and other agencies.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Strong skills in writing specifications and managing, documenting, and accounting for renovation and construction projects.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Knowledge and experience with safety programs, emergency response planning, fire inspections/alarm systems, accident reporting and investigation, and federal/state compliance requirements.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Strong communication, organizational, supervisory, and leadership skills.</p><p style="margin-left:20.15pt;">Such alternatives to the above qualifications as the Board may find appropriate and acceptable.</p><p><strong>Employment Term:&nbsp; </strong>Full-time, 12-month salaried position; eligible for benefits.</p><p><strong>Salary:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>District Salary Schedule for 2026-2027 base salary - $79,000 (Pro-rated for partial year).&nbsp; Starting salary may be increased based on qualifications and relevant experience</p><p><strong>Beginning Date:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; December 1, 2026</p><p><strong>Closing Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>Open until filled</p><p>For questions or concerns call 307-764-6186</p><p><span style="font-size:10.0pt;">Park County School District #1 does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, sex, age, or disability in admission or access to, or treatment of employment in, its educational programs or activities. Inquiries concerning Title VI, Title IX, Section 504, and ADA may be referred to Park County School District #1, Ginger Sleep, Civil Rights Coordinator, 307-764-6186, 160 North Evarts, Powell, Wyoming 82435, or the Office for Civil Rights, Region VIII, U.S. Department of Education, Federal Building, Suite 310, 1244 Speer Blvd., Denver, Colorado 80204-03582, (303) 844-5695 or TDD 303-844-3417.</span></p></span><br /><img src=\'https://www.applitrack.com/clear.gif\' height=8><br /></span><div class="AppliTrackJobPostingAttachments">Attachment(s):<ul><li><a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://www.applitrack.com/park1/onlineapp/1BrowseFile.aspx?id=22224">Maintenance Supervisor.pdf</a></li><li><a rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://www.applitrack.com/park1/onlineapp/1BrowseFile.aspx?id=22223">Prof Non Cert Schedule 2026-27.pdf</a></li></ul></div><br/><div class=\'label\' align=\'right\' style=\'position:absolute; top:0%;right:1%;\'><span class=\'s\'><div class="addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style "><a class="addthis_button_preferred_1"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_2"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_3"></a><a class="addthis_button_compact"></a><a class="addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style"></a></div><script type="text/javascript" src="https://s7.addthis.com/js/250/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-4dfeb954767d3dc8"></script><br><a href=\'javascript:updateEmailLinkFromCurrentWindowLocation("mailto:?subject=Job Posting&body=","I thought you would be interested in an employment opportunity I found at Park County School District #1. The position is Maintenance Supervisor. Please click the link below for more information about this vacancy.","ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=695&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1")\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Email To A Friend</span></a><br/><a href=\'javascript:updateHrefFromCurrentWindowLocation("ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=695&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1" , true, false, true)\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Print Version</span> </a><br/></span></div><br/></div></ul><div style=\'width: 100%; height: .75px; background: gray; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom:4px;\'></div><br /><p align=center class=noprint id=\'p631_h\'><span class=\'ListHeader\'>Openings as of 10/30/2026<br/></span></p><ul class=\'postingsList\' id=\'p631_\'><table class=\'title\' style=\'padding: 0px; width:99.2%\'><tr><td id=\'wrapword\' style=\'width: 950px; padding: 5px;\'>Substitute School Nurse</td><td style=\'width: 275px;\'><span class=\'title2\' style=\'float:right;text-align:right;margin-top: 8px;margin-right: 6px;\'> JobID: 631 <input type=\'button\' value=\' Apply \' onclick="applyFor(\'631\',\'Student Support Services\',\'Substitute School Nurse\')" class=\'screenOnly ApplyButton\' /></span></td></tr></table><div style=\'position:relative;\'><li><span class=\'label\'>Position Type:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Student Support Services/</span><span class=\'normal\'>Substitute School Nurse</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Posted:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">9/18/2025</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Location:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">District-Wide K-12</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Available:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;');
document.write('<span class=\'normal\'>ASAP</span><br/><br/></li><span>&nbsp&nbsp</span><span class="label" >Additional Information: &nbsp;</span><span class="normal"><a href="javascript:void(toggle_block(\'DescriptionText631_\'))"><u>Show/Hide</u></a></span><br/><span id=\'DescriptionText631_\' style=\'border: 1px solid black; padding:5px; display:none; opacity:.8;\'><span class="normal">To work on an as needed basis when the regular school nurse is absent.&nbsp; This position is on an as needed basis and is non-benefit eligible.<br /> Pay: $30.00 per hour<br /> Here are the qualifications from the Nurse job description on our website.<br /> <br /> <u>Education, License, Certification, or Formal Training</u> <ul><li>&nbsp;Current license to practice as a registered professional nurse in Wyoming</li> <li>Registered Nurse with a Two-year (Associate&rsquo;s) or Four-year (Bachelor&rsquo;s) degree, from an accredited college or university</li> <li>Some coursework and/or experience in education &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; preferred</li> </ul> &nbsp;<br /> <u>Knowledge, Skills, and Mental Ability</u> <ul><li>Ability to work with various personality types</li> <li>Sound emotional judgment</li> <li>Visual acuity, aided or non-aided, to read and interpret accurately written reports of a technical nature</li> <li>Ability to enunciate clearly and communicate positively throughout the work day</li> <li>Ability to follow and successfully complete both written and oral directions</li> <li>Ability to calculate accurately</li> <li>Knowledge of basic computer commands to run software related to word processing and administrative/instructional applications on a personal computer</li> </ul> &nbsp;<br /> <u>Physical Demands</u> <ul><li>Visual acuity and stamina to work at a computer &nbsp;&nbsp;monitor for at least a reasonable part of the day</li> <li>Sufficient strength to lift boxes or equipment that may weigh as much as fifty (50) pounds and be able to move them as far as fifty feet (50&rsquo;)</li> <li>Sufficient strength and stamina to remain seated for periods as long as two (2) hours without fatigue or discomfort</li> <li>Sufficient strength and stamina to remain standing for periods as long as two (2) hours without fatigue or discomfort</li> <li>Sufficient strength and stamina to remain in a &ldquo;squatting&rdquo; position for a reasonable period of time during the school day without fatigue or discomfort</li> </ul> &nbsp;<br /> <u>Environmental Demands</u> <ul><li>Ability to work in air conditioned and non-air conditioned buildings</li> <li>Frequent exposure to various supplies containing hazardous materials or chemicals</li> <li>Occasional exposure to weather extremes</li> <li>Occupationally exposed to bloodborne pathogens and other potentially infectious materials</li> </ul> &nbsp;<br /> Park County School District #1 does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, sex, age, or disability in admission or access to, or treatment of employment in, its educational programs or activities.&nbsp; Inquiries concerning Title VI, Title IX, Section 504, and ADA may be referred to Park County School District #1, Ginger Sleep, Civil Rights Coordinator, 307-764-6186, 160 North Evarts, Powell, Wyoming 82435, or the Office for Civil Rights, Region VIII, U.S. Department of Education, Federal Building, Suite 310, 1244 Speer Blvd., Denver, Colorado 80204-03582, (303) 844-5695 or TDD 303-844-3417.<br /> &nbsp;</span><br /><img src=\'https://www.applitrack.com/clear.gif\' height=8><br /></span><br/><div class=\'label\' align=\'right\' style=\'position:absolute; top:0%;right:1%;\'><span class=\'s\'><div class="addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style "><a class="addthis_button_preferred_1"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_2"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_3"></a><a class="addthis_button_compact"></a><a class="addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style"></a></div><script type="text/javascript" src="https://s7.addthis.com/js/250/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-4dfeb954767d3dc8"></script><br><a href=\'javascript:updateEmailLinkFromCurrentWindowLocation("mailto:?subject=Job Posting&body=","I thought you would be interested in an employment opportunity I found at Park County School District #1. The position is Substitute School Nurse. Please click the link below for more information about this vacancy.","ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=631&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1")\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Email To A Friend</span></a><br/><a href=\'javascript:updateHrefFromCurrentWindowLocation("ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=631&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1" , true, false, true)\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Print Version</span> </a><br/></span></div><br/></div></ul><div style=\'width: 100%; height: .75px; background: gray; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom:4px;\'></div><br /><p align=center class=noprint id=\'p580_h\'><span class=\'ListHeader\'>Openings as of 10/30/2026<br/></span></p><ul class=\'postingsList\' id=\'p580_\'><table class=\'title\' style=\'padding: 0px; width:99.2%\'><tr><td id=\'wrapword\' style=\'width: 950px; padding: 5px;\'>Substitute Teacher</td><td style=\'width: 275px;\'><span class=\'title2\' style=\'float:right;text-align:right;margin-top: 8px;margin-right: 6px;\'> JobID: 580 <input type=\'button\' value=\' Apply \' onclick="applyFor(\'580\',\'Substitute\',\'Substitute Teacher\')" class=\'screenOnly ApplyButton\' /></span></td></tr></table><div style=\'position:relative;\'><li><span class=\'label\'>Position Type:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Substitute/</span><span class=\'normal\'>Substitute Teacher</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Posted:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">7/3/2024</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Location:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">District-Wide K-12</span><br/><br/></li><span>&nbsp&nbsp</span><span class="label" >Additional Information: &nbsp;</span><span class="normal"><a href="javascript:void(toggle_block(\'DescriptionText580_\'))"><u>Show/Hide</u></a></span><br/><span id=\'DescriptionText580_\' style=\'border: 1px solid black; padding:5px; display:none; opacity:.8;\'>');
document.write('<span class="normal"><p><img src="file:///C:/Users/JIRuward/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif" width="2" height="2"><img src="file:///C:/Users/JIRuward/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif" width="2" height="2">QUALIFICATIONS: Holder of Wyoming teaching certificate or substitute permit obtained through the Wyoming Professional Teaching Standards Board, The website is -&nbsp; &nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://wyomingptsb.com/">https://wyomingptsb.com/</a><br>&nbsp;<br>REPORTS TO: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Building Principal<br>&nbsp;<br>JOB GOAL:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; To enable each student to pursue his/her education as smoothly and completely as possible in the absence of the regular teacher<br><br>PAY:&nbsp;&nbsp;$20.65/hour with a 4 hour minimum guarantee if not employed in another capacity with the district.&nbsp;&nbsp;Substitutes that are not employed in another capacity with the district will receive a .50 cent/hour increase after working 320 hours (40 days/8 hrs/day) in a fiscal year July 1 through June 30 as a substitute in each specific job category.<br><br><span style="color:#FF0000;font-size:22px;"><strong><u>ONCE YOUR APPLICATION IS COMPLETE; COME TO THE CENTRAL ADMINISTRATION OFFICE (160 N Evarts Street) TO COMPLETE PAYROLL PAPERWORK. &nbsp;See our webpage for more information </u></strong></span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.pcsd1.org/page/substitute-process"><span style="color:#FF0000;font-size:22px;"><strong><u>https://www.pcsd1.org/page/substitute-process</u></strong></span></a></p></span><br /><img src=\'https://www.applitrack.com/clear.gif\' height=8><br /></span><br/><div class=\'label\' align=\'right\' style=\'position:absolute; top:0%;right:1%;\'><span class=\'s\'><div class="addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style "><a class="addthis_button_preferred_1"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_2"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_3"></a><a class="addthis_button_compact"></a><a class="addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style"></a></div><script type="text/javascript" src="https://s7.addthis.com/js/250/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-4dfeb954767d3dc8"></script><br><a href=\'javascript:updateEmailLinkFromCurrentWindowLocation("mailto:?subject=Job Posting&body=","I thought you would be interested in an employment opportunity I found at Park County School District #1. The position is Substitute Teacher. Please click the link below for more information about this vacancy.","ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=580&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1")\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Email To A Friend</span></a><br/><a href=\'javascript:updateHrefFromCurrentWindowLocation("ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=580&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1" , true, false, true)\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Print Version</span> </a><br/></span></div><br/></div></ul><div style=\'width: 100%; height: .75px; background: gray; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom:4px;\'></div><br /><p align=center class=noprint id=\'p582_h\'><span class=\'ListHeader\'>Openings as of 10/30/2026<br/></span></p><ul class=\'postingsList\' id=\'p582_\'><table class=\'title\' style=\'padding: 0px; width:99.2%\'><tr><td id=\'wrapword\' style=\'width: 950px; padding: 5px;\'>Substitute Custodian</td><td style=\'width: 275px;\'><span class=\'title2\' style=\'float:right;text-align:right;margin-top: 8px;margin-right: 6px;\'> JobID: 582 <input type=\'button\' value=\' Apply \' onclick="applyFor(\'582\',\'Substitute Support Services\',\'Substitute Custodial\')" class=\'screenOnly ApplyButton\' /></span></td></tr></table><div style=\'position:relative;\'><li><span class=\'label\'>Position Type:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Substitute Support Services/</span><span class=\'normal\'>Substitute Custodial</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Posted:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">7/3/2024</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Location:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">District-Wide K-12</span><br/><br/></li><span>&nbsp&nbsp</span><span class="label" >Additional Information: &nbsp;</span><span class="normal"><a href="javascript:void(toggle_block(\'DescriptionText582_\'))"><u>Show/Hide</u></a></span><br/><span id=\'DescriptionText582_\' style=\'border: 1px solid black; padding:5px; display:none; opacity:.8;\'><span class="normal">Act as a substitute in our custodial department when permanent employee&#39;s are absence on an as needed basis.&nbsp; Shifts and positions vary according to position.<br /> <br /> REPORTS TO: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Building Principal and Coordinator of Support Services.&nbsp; Cooperates with assigned building custodian in a mentor relationship for standardization of custodial practices and procedures.<br /> &nbsp;<br /> JOB GOAL:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; To provide students with a safe, attractive, clean, and comfortable environment so they can take full advantage of the District&rsquo;s educational opportunities; to contribute to a positive school atmosphere by offering pleasant, accommodating custodial services for students and staff<br /> <br /> PAY:&nbsp;&nbsp;All other substitutes will be paid at Step 1 of their corresponding assignment classification.&nbsp; Building custodian:&nbsp; $18.30 per hour; $17.55 per hour<br /> <br /> <span style="color:#FF0000;"><u><strong>ONCE YOUR APPLICATION IS COMPLETE; COME TO THE CENTRAL ADMINISTRATION OFFICE (160 N Evarts Street) TO COMPLETE PAYROLL PAPERWORK.</strong></u></span><br /> <br /> <br /> &nbsp;</span><br /><img src=\'https://www.applitrack.com/clear.gif\' height=8><br /></span><br/><div class=\'label\' align=\'right\' style=\'position:absolute; top:0%;right:1%;\'><span class=\'s\'>');
document.write('<div class="addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style "><a class="addthis_button_preferred_1"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_2"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_3"></a><a class="addthis_button_compact"></a><a class="addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style"></a></div><script type="text/javascript" src="https://s7.addthis.com/js/250/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-4dfeb954767d3dc8"></script><br><a href=\'javascript:updateEmailLinkFromCurrentWindowLocation("mailto:?subject=Job Posting&body=","I thought you would be interested in an employment opportunity I found at Park County School District #1. The position is Substitute Custodian. Please click the link below for more information about this vacancy.","ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=582&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1")\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Email To A Friend</span></a><br/><a href=\'javascript:updateHrefFromCurrentWindowLocation("ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=582&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1" , true, false, true)\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Print Version</span> </a><br/></span></div><br/></div></ul><div style=\'width: 100%; height: .75px; background: gray; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom:4px;\'></div><br /><p align=center class=noprint id=\'p581_h\'><span class=\'ListHeader\'>Openings as of 10/30/2026<br/></span></p><ul class=\'postingsList\' id=\'p581_\'><table class=\'title\' style=\'padding: 0px; width:99.2%\'><tr><td id=\'wrapword\' style=\'width: 950px; padding: 5px;\'>Substitute Para-Educator</td><td style=\'width: 275px;\'><span class=\'title2\' style=\'float:right;text-align:right;margin-top: 8px;margin-right: 6px;\'> JobID: 581 <input type=\'button\' value=\' Apply \' onclick="applyFor(\'581\',\'Substitute Support Services\',\'Substitute Para-Educator\')" class=\'screenOnly ApplyButton\' /></span></td></tr></table><div style=\'position:relative;\'><li><span class=\'label\'>Position Type:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Substitute Support Services/</span><span class=\'normal\'>Substitute Para-Educator</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Posted:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">7/3/2024</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Location:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">District-Wide K-12</span><br/><br/></li><span>&nbsp&nbsp</span><span class="label" >Additional Information: &nbsp;</span><span class="normal"><a href="javascript:void(toggle_block(\'DescriptionText581_\'))"><u>Show/Hide</u></a></span><br/><span id=\'DescriptionText581_\' style=\'border: 1px solid black; padding:5px; display:none; opacity:.8;\'><span class="normal">To cover on an as needed basis when an absence occurs for a para-educator position.&nbsp; Each position and the hours differ.<br /> <br /> REPORTS TO: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Building Principal<br /> &nbsp;<br /> JOB GOAL:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; To assist with maintenance of a well-organized, smoothly functioning classroom so the teacher may devote maximum attention to the instructional program and meeting the educational needs of students; to contribute to a positive school atmosphere by offering pleasant, accommodating services to parents, students and staff<br /> <br /> PAY:&nbsp; $16.35 per hour (step 1 on para schedule); substitute special education para-educators will be paid $1.00 more an hour than base.<br /> <br /> <span style="color:#FF0000;"><u><strong>ONCE YOUR APPLICATION IS COMPLETE; COME TO THE CENTRAL ADMINISTRATION OFFICE (160 N Evarts Street) TO COMPLETE PAYROLL PAPERWORK.</strong></u></span></span><br /><img src=\'https://www.applitrack.com/clear.gif\' height=8><br /></span><br/><div class=\'label\' align=\'right\' style=\'position:absolute; top:0%;right:1%;\'><span class=\'s\'><div class="addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style "><a class="addthis_button_preferred_1"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_2"></a><a class="addthis_button_preferred_3"></a><a class="addthis_button_compact"></a><a class="addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style"></a></div><script type="text/javascript" src="https://s7.addthis.com/js/250/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-4dfeb954767d3dc8"></script><br><a href=\'javascript:updateEmailLinkFromCurrentWindowLocation("mailto:?subject=Job Posting&body=","I thought you would be interested in an employment opportunity I found at Park County School District #1. The position is Substitute Para-Educator. Please click the link below for more information about this vacancy.","ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=581&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1")\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Email To A Friend</span></a><br/><a href=\'javascript:updateHrefFromCurrentWindowLocation("ApplitrackHardcodedURL?1=1&AppliTrackJobId=581&AppliTrackLayoutMode=detail&AppliTrackViewPosting=1" , true, false, true)\'><span style=\'color:#4c4c4c;font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;\'>Print Version</span> </a><br/></span></div>');
document.write('<br/></div></ul><div style=\'width: 100%; height: .75px; background: gray; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom:4px;\'></div><br /><p align=center class=noprint id=\'p396_h\'><span class=\'ListHeader\'>Openings as of 10/30/2026<br/></span></p><ul class=\'postingsList\' id=\'p396_\'><table class=\'title\' style=\'padding: 0px; width:99.2%\'><tr><td id=\'wrapword\' style=\'width: 950px; padding: 5px;\'>Substitute Bus Driver</td><td style=\'width: 275px;\'><span class=\'title2\' style=\'float:right;text-align:right;margin-top: 8px;margin-right: 6px;\'> JobID: 396 <input type=\'button\' value=\' Apply \' onclick="applyFor(\'396\',\'Transportation\',\'Route Bus Driver\')" class=\'screenOnly ApplyButton\' /></span></td></tr></table><div style=\'position:relative;\'><li><span class=\'label\'>Position Type:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Transportation/</span><span class=\'normal\'>Route Bus Driver</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Posted:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">9/27/2021</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Location:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="normal">Transportation Department</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" >Date Available:</span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>ASAP</span><br/><br/></li><li><span class="label" > Closing Date: </span><br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\'normal\'>Until Filled</span><br/><br/></li><span>&nbsp&nbsp</span><span class="label" >Additional Information: &nbsp;</span><span class="normal"><a href="javascript:void(toggle_block(\'DescriptionText396_\'))"><u>Show/Hide</u></a></span><br/><span id=\'DescriptionText396_\' style=\'border: 1px solid black; padding:5px; display:none; opacity:.8;\'><span class="normal">Position:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Bus Driver<br /> Duties:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /> Serve as a member of the District&rsquo;s transportation team; provide students with safe and efficient transportation to and from school so they can fully benefit from the learning opportunities available through the District&rsquo;s instructional program; provide transportation for students and staff on field trips, out-of-school activities, and/or athletic trips as may be assigned; work cooperatively with District and building-level personnel on busing issues to ensure an effective, quality transportation program<br /> <br /> Qualifications:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /> -High school graduate or equivalent required<br /> -Demonstrated aptitude for and competence in operation of a school bus, both for a regular route and for school activities<br /> -Possession of, or ability to obtain, a Wyoming CDL class B, with passenger, air brake, and school bus endorsements.<br /> -Demonstrated ability to work effectively and cooperatively with members of the transportation team, parents, students, and other District staff<br /> - Ability to meet the requirements outlined in the District&rsquo;s <u>Activity/Route Bus Driver&rsquo;s Handbook</u><br /> -Willingness to abide by all District guidelines for bus drivers/transportation and to adapt to specific or new working situations<br /> <br /> Salary:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; District Support Services Wage Schedule (Base=$17.25/hour)<br /> <br /> Employment Term:&nbsp;&nbsp; Up to four and one-half (4.75) hours per day for route assignment plus assigned activity trips during school year &ndash; 175 days for 2021-2022 school year<br /> <br /> Beginning Date:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ASAP<br /> Closing Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Until filled<br /> <br /> Park County School District #1 does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, sex, age, or disability in admission or access to, or treatment of employment in, its educational programs or activities.&nbsp; Inquiries concerning Title VI, Title IX, Section 504, and ADA may be referred to Park County School District #1, Ginger Sleep, Civil Rights Coordinator, 307-764-6186, 160 North Evarts, Powell, Wyoming 82435, or the Office for Civil Rights, Region VIII, U.S. Department of Education, Federal Building, Suite 310, 1244 Speer Blvd., Denver, Colorado 80204-03582, (303) 844-5695 or TDD 303-844-3417.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</span><br /><img src=\'https://www.applitrack.com/clear.gif\' height=8><br /></span><br/><div class=\'label\' align=\'right\' style=\'position:absolute; top:0%;right:1%;\'><span class=\'s\'>');
